01:57:02.220 --> 01:57:04.140
Males was the brainchild of

01:57:04.140 --> 01:57:06.200
Pastor Bill Lawson and members of the

01:57:06.200 --> 01:57:08.320
Wheeler Avenue Baptist Church Congregation.

01:57:08.540 --> 01:57:10.140
I think that all of us, not just blacks,

01:57:10.300 --> 01:57:11.960
I think that all of us have been watching

01:57:11.960 --> 01:57:14.140
for some time the ugly statistics of

01:57:14.140 --> 01:57:16.060
what is happening to the young black male.

01:57:16.580 --> 01:57:18.500
He's on drugs, he's going to jail,

01:57:18.660 --> 01:57:20.660
he's dropping out of school, he's impregnating

01:57:20.660 --> 01:57:22.600
teenage girls, and we felt

01:57:22.600 --> 01:57:24.400
that it was not enough for us to

01:57:24.400 --> 01:57:26.320
simply decry what is going wrong.

01:57:26.700 --> 01:57:28.360
At some point, somebody needed to

01:57:28.360 --> 01:57:29.980
do something to try to...

01:57:30.030 --> 01:57:34.010
turn that around and we can't depend on the federal government to do it our health and human

01:57:34.010 --> 01:57:39.780
services it's going to have to be done by us and so what we wanted to do here was to bring together

01:57:39.780 --> 01:57:45.280
three institutions that really should touch young black males home school and church and see if it

01:57:45.280 --> 01:57:51.750
was possible to get them once again to to uh to work together on trying to turn boys around

01:57:51.750 --> 01:57:57.880
meaning to pass to the boys the values of the elders and so we've decided on what's called

01:57:57.880 --> 01:57:58.880
rights of passage.

01:57:58.980 --> 01:57:59.980
The entire community was

01:58:00.000 --> 01:58:04.540
